                                "sense_id": "8b8d19e9-440e-3e18-973a-4de1c78b47de",
                                "text": "He was sentenced to be hung without any trial worth speaking of; but as he was carted to the gallows an old woman cried out, \"Ach, Jimmy alanna!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "71124ae4-4781-4b54-94d3-8170d9ee4741",
                                "sense_id": "8b8d19e9-440e-3e18-973a-4de1c78b47de",
                                "text": "Well, alanna,\" he continued in an altered tone, \"don't be frettin' yourself anyway."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdeffa10-bd96-4745-8583-6a3243591f54",
                                "sense_id": "8b8d19e9-440e-3e18-973a-4de1c78b47de",
                                "text": "Come here, alanna,\" said the voice, with mock fondness."
                            }
                        ]
